[32m+[m[32m- [ ] **Financial dashboard and reports:** Overview shows this month's total received income, total allocated, total expenses, available balance, amount given, and Business, Emergency Savings, Long-term Investment, Learning and Enjoyment balances. Include monthly allocation, actual versus planned spending, recent transactions, monthly trends, category utilization and financial goals/progress. Provide monthly, quarterly and annual reports; income versus expenses; planned versus actual allocation; business reinvestment; emergency savings; learning investments; and long-term contributions. Offer CSV and PDF exports where supported. Every statistic, chart and report must use actual stored records only; do not fabricate financial data or seed sample records. Keep totals separated by currency and make the selected period/currency clear.[m
