[32m+[m[32m- [x] **Personal Finance security, design and integrity:** Use a normalized finance model and existing database, authentication, admin authorization, storage and AI-provider infrastructure where available. Financial operations execute on the server; all API inputs are validated; allocation processing is atomic and idempotent; exact minor-unit arithmetic prevents floating-point errors; transfer accounting cannot create artificial income/expense; plan and transaction history are preserved; no private financial data is exposed to public routes or ordinary logs. Follow the existing Bereda admin design while applying the specified deep green `#1B4332`, forest `#2D6A4F`, gold `#D4A437`, terracotta `#C1693C`, warm cream `#FAF6EC` accents, Fraunces/Inter stacks and responsive behavior. No bank integrations, automatic investment orders, guaranteed-return projections, or unsupported storage/AI readiness may be claimed. Verify the 10,000 ETB example, multiple/edited/expected/received/cancelled income, tiny rounding values, currency separation, partial spending, category transfers, savings balance separation and historical plan versions without mutating shared database records.[m
